  "description": "The Firmstrong Bella Fashionista is a sleek, high-end cruiser designed for women who want a bike that looks as good as it rides. It features a new-school frame design with a high-arching top tube that slopes down, making it very easy to step over and mount. Beyond its modern look, the Fashionista is built with reliable components like painted wheels and front and rear fenders, which not only look great but also protect the bike from the elements.\n\nThe 15-inch steel frame has an extra 2 inches of length, making it a comfortable fit for most riders between 5 feet 2 inches and 6 feet tall. Because the frame is made of durable steel and fully painted, it is built to last a long time without issues like rust. As a single-speed bike, the Fashionista has a very clean look with no messy cables or gears to worry about. The single gear is tucked safely inside the rear hub, and its resistance is set right in the sweet spot—similar to the middle gears on a mountain bike. This gives you enough power to pick up speed on flat paths while still being easy enough to pedal over minor hills.\n\nThe ride itself is smooth and effortless thanks to the wide tires and dual-spring saddle, which do a great job of soaking up bumps in the road. For braking, it uses the classic coaster brake system where you just pedal backwards to stop. It is a simple, low-maintenance bike that allows you to just hop on and enjoy the cruise without having to shift gears or adjust complicated parts. The Bella Fashionista is perfect for anyone who wants a durable, stylish bicycle that stands out on the boardwalk or around the neighborhood.\n\n15” Extended Length Steel Frame with 26” Painted Aluminum Wheels and Front/Rear Fenders\n\nGreat recreational riding bike for taller women or those who would like more arm extension. 2” extended frame creates more space between rider and handlebars.\n\nThick Top Tube Design, Front/Rear Fenders, and Painted Rims.\n\nDual Spring Oversized Seat for Added Comfort\n\n2.125” Wide White-Wall Tires provide a cushioned, relaxed ride for easy rolling\n\n28.5” Wide Chrome Plated Cruiser Bike Handlebars with Synthetic Leather Black Grips\n\nBicycle Weighs 36 lbs. Fully Assembled\n\nFits Most Women 5’2\" – 6’ Tall\n\nRecommended Riding Speed 3 – 15mph\n\nRecommended Riding Distance 0 – 40 miles in a single trip\n\nThe Seat and Handlebar Height and Tilt can be adjusted to properly fit the rider\n\nBike comes 80% Assembled, Assembly is easy and fun!\n\nDesigned in Hermosa Beach, CA.",
